& [Implementation]
  + an isolated provider_protocol module extends the proven P0 chat-completion grammar without invoking its transport
  + iterative_advance_request deterministically constructs first and READY-continuation requests from model prompt RunPolicy opening handle and verified prior iterations
  + every advance request exposes exactly one required advance_attention_procedure tool with one host-selected constant quota parallel calls false thinking disabled temperature zero and a bounded response budget
  + admit_iterative_provider_iteration sanitizes the raw response admits exactly one nonempty unique function call and joins it to a separately validated DeterministicDriveResult containing exactly one compact advance
  + READY admission requires the one-advance driver to stop honestly at its call cap with live reentry while terminal admission derives its projection from the exact terminal observation
  + IterationRecord index predecessor request sanitized response call identity quota compact response and successor are constructed by the host instead of accepted from the provider
  + validate_iterative_provider_prefix reconstructs each request and public transcript checks every call and compact link and projects the exact current phase and head
  + iterative_terminal_reflection_request is available only after a terminal final iteration and disables all tools under the identity-constant final schema

& [Transcript]
  + first request contains system and user messages
  + each admitted iteration contributes one normalized assistant tool-call message followed by one matching tool projection message
  + READY projection is the only continuation material imported from the compact procedure state
  + terminal reflection carries all ordered public assistant and projection pairs followed by one explicit reflection checkpoint
  + exact registry checkpoint context terminal record and private reasoning remain absent from provider messages

& [HonestyAndSecurity]
  + protocol evidence and deterministic advancement remain separate until admission verifies both halves and their common predecessor and successor
  + sanitized provider evidence is idempotently checked so retained private-reasoning keys refuse replay
  + wrong quota tool name tool type premature content empty duplicate or oversized call identity refuses
  + changed request predecessor compact response successor projection ordering phase head model or nonclaim refuses
  + mismatched-session and multi-advance deterministic results cannot be attributed to one provider call
  + protocol conformance does not authenticate a producer or establish correct reasoning semantic truth or effects

& [ProofShape]
  + five provider-free focused tests cover the exact first READY continuation terminal reflection and final-output path
  + tests also cover deterministic request replay sanitation call identity cap terminal state closed projection and adversarial joins
  + existing P0 and Slice2 tests remain green without provider network or process activity

& [Rollback]
  + the module exports and focused test are additive
  + P0 provider helpers Slice1 reports and Slice2 deterministic driver remain independently callable

& [Deferred]
  + Slice4 loopback process orchestration timing usage stopped reports and actual provider calls remain unimplemented and unactivated
